With Enumerable.java you can use Guava like this (+ static imports):<p><pre><code>    List<String> strings = transform(list("hello", "world"), 
        function(s, s.toUpperCase()));
    assertEquals(list("HELLO", "WORLD"), strings);
</code></pre>
<a href="https://github.com/hraberg/enumerable" rel="nofollow">https://github.com/hraberg/enumerable</a>
